    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Taking everything into account, I think we're dealing with knee osteoarthritis flare at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. A meniscal tear is still possible. I'll request an X-ray of the knee, it'll help with knee pain.",
